# `search` works with no credentials: anonymous Tako search by default, or
# Parallel's free Search MCP when WEBSEARCH_BACKEND=parallel. Each key layers on:
#   TAKO_API_KEY         — Tako REST search with filters, and `deep-research`
#                          on the Tako Answer Agent (WEBSEARCH_BACKEND=tako)
#   PARALLEL_API_KEY     — Parallel Search REST, and `deep-research` on the
#                          Parallel Task API (WEBSEARCH_BACKEND=parallel)
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY    — Claude synthesis on top of `search` results
#
# WEBSEARCH_BACKEND is deployment config (set it in sandbox.extraEnv), not a
# secret. Other non-secret config (synthesis model, base URLs) is set on
# WebSearchClient(...) at construction time.
# Leave a key commented out to run without it. An exported-but-empty value and
# an absent one both fall back to anonymous search.
WEBSEARCH_BACKEND=tako
# TAKO_API_KEY=
# PARALLEL_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
